</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     4. RENTAL WORKFLOW TIMELINE (SECTION 14)
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="how-it-works" class="section workflow-section" aria-label="SkipIt Rental Workflow">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Rental Lifecycle</span>
      <h2>How SkipIt works in 5 simple steps.</h2>
      <p>The core peer-to-peer workflow designed for maximum transparency, trust, and ease.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="workflow-timeline">
      <!-- 01 Discover -->
      <div class="wf-step-card reveal">
        <div class="wf-num">STEP 01</div>
        <div class="wf-title">Discover</div>
        <div class="wf-desc">Browse verified listings nearby with transparent daily rates, item specs, and refundable deposit amounts.</div>
      </div>

      <!-- 02 Verify -->
      <div class="wf-step-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="wf-num">STEP 02</div>
        <div class="wf-title">Verify</div>
        <div class="wf-desc">Fast identity verification and KYC checks establish community accountability and protect both parties.</div>
      </div>

      <!-- 03 Book & Pay -->
      <div class="wf-step-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="wf-num">STEP 03</div>
        <div class="wf-title">Book &amp; Pay</div>
        <div class="wf-desc">Complete your secure booking. Security deposit is held safely in escrow and never treated as platform earnings.</div>
      </div>

      <!-- 04 Rent & Use -->
      <div class="wf-step-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="wf-num">STEP 04</div>
        <div class="wf-title">Rent &amp; Use</div>
        <div class="wf-desc">Coordinate convenient handover directly with the owner, inspect the item together, and use it when you need it.</div>
      </div>

      <!-- 05 Return & Review -->
      <div class="wf-step-card reveal reveal-delay-4">
        <div class="wf-num">STEP 05</div>
        <div class="wf-title">Return &amp; Review</div>
        <div class="wf-desc">Return the product safely to release your full security deposit, and leave a review to build community trust.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     5. TRUST & SAFETY (SECTION 15)
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="trust" class="section" aria-label="Trust and safety">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Infrastructure of Trust</span>
      <h2>Renting works when trust is built in.</h2>
      <p>SkipIt is not just a classifieds board. We build multi-layered security infrastructure designed specifically for peer-to-peer rentals.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="trust-grid">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="trust-card reveal">
        <div class="trust-card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Identity &amp; KYC Verification</h3>
        <p>Government ID checks and verified phone numbers ensure you know exactly who you are renting to or from, preventing anonymous bad actors.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="trust-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="trust-card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Listing Integrity &amp; Checks</h3>
        <p>Automated moderation screening for prohibited items, duplicate images, and abnormal pricing outliers before listings can be published.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="trust-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="trust-card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Escrow Transaction Protection</h3>
        <p>Payments and security deposits are locked in secure escrow until item handover and return are mutually confirmed by both parties.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="trust-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="trust-card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Risk Controls &amp; Signals</h3>
        <p>Continuous monitoring for suspicious behavioral patterns, abnormal rental frequencies, and structured dispute resolution protocols.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     6. REVENUE TRANSPARENCY (SECTION 4 & 17)
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="revenue" class="section" aria-label="Revenue Transparency">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Financial Clarity</span>
      <h2>Transparent economics for every rental.</h2>
      <p>We believe in 100% financial clarity. Here is exactly where every rupee goes during a SkipIt rental transaction.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="revenue-flow-grid reveal">
      <!-- Renter Pays -->
      <div class="rev-box">
        <div class="rev-box-tag">Renter Transaction</div>
        <h3>What the Renter Pays</h3>
        <p>Clear pricing upfront with zero hidden fees. Renter pays only for the days they use plus required security.</p>
        <div class="rev-list">
          <div class="rev-list-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Rental Fee (Days × Daily Rate)
          </div>
          <div class="rev-list-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Refundable Security Deposit
          </div>
          <div class="rev-list-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Optional Damage Protection Plan
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Security Deposit Escrow -->
      <div class="rev-box rev-highlight-card">
        <div class="rev-box-tag" style="color:#7AABFF">Escrow Security</div>
        <h3>Security Deposits — NOT Platform Revenue</h3>
        <p>Security deposits are held separately in escrow. They are returned 100% to the renter once the product is safely inspected and returned.</p>
        <div class="rev-list">
          <div class="rev-list-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Held separately in secure escrow
          </div>
          <div class="rev-list-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            100% returned on safe handover
          </div>
          <div class="rev-list-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Never mixed with SkipIt earnings
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Owner Receives -->
      <div class="rev-box">
        <div class="rev-box-tag">Owner Payout</div>
        <h3>What the Owner Receives</h3>
        <p>Owners receive the rental amount minus a 12% platform fee that powers identity verification, server hosting, and support.</p>
        <div class="rev-list">
          <div class="rev-list-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            88% net rental fee paid directly
          </div>
          <div class="rev-list-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            SkipIt retains 12% platform commission
          </div>
          <div class="rev-list-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Direct bank transfer upon return
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     7. FOR OWNERS (SECTION 16)
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="for-owners" class="section" aria-label="For Item Owners">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split-section">
      <div class="split-content reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:12px">Earn from idle assets</span>
        <h2>Turn idle assets into earning opportunities.</h2>
        <p>List products you're not using and make them available to people who need them temporarily. You set your prices, manage availability dates, and earn effortlessly.</p>

        <!-- 4-Step Owner Flow -->
        <div class="owner-steps">
          <div class="owner-step-item">
