              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit-text">
              <h4>Rent Exclusively to Verified Users</h4>
              <p>All renters complete identity checks before booking your equipment.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <button class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" onclick="openListModal()">
          List an Item Now →
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="split-visual reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="split-visual-img">
          <img src="images/product_camera.jpg" alt="Owner listing equipment on SkipIt">
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:20px;padding:20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border-radius:var(--radius-xl);border:1px solid var(--glass-border)">
          <div style="font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--electric-blue);margin-bottom:8px">Owner Spotlight</div>
          <div style="font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:4px">Rahul M. — Bengaluru</div>
          <div style="font-size:.875rem;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:12px">Earned ₹14,200 renting his Sony Alpha camera during off-weeks.</div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
            <span class="badge badge--green">★ 4.9 Rating (34 Rentals)</span>
            <span style="font-weight:800;color:#ffffff">100% Return Rate</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     8. OPTIONAL PROTECTION PLANS
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="protection" class="section" aria-label="Protection Plans">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Peace of Mind</span>
      <h2>Optional protection plans for every rental.</h2>
      <p>Protection plans reduce liability for accidental damage or eligible incidents during the rental period. Optional add-ons, never mandatory.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="plans-grid">
      <!-- Basic -->
      <div class="plan-card reveal">
        <div style="font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:8px">Tier 01</div>
        <div class="plan-tier">Basic</div>
        <div class="plan-description">Baseline coverage for minor scuffs, light accidental scratches, and everyday rental wear.</div>
        <div class="plan-features">
          <div class="plan-feature">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Up to ₹5,000 accidental damage
          </div>
          <div class="plan-feature">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Standard resolution window
          </div>
          <div class="plan-feature">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Available on all everyday items
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Premium -->
      <div class="plan-card plan-card--featured reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="plan-badge">Most Popular</div>
        <div style="font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--electric-blue);margin-bottom:8px">Tier 02</div>
        <div class="plan-tier">Premium</div>
        <div class="plan-description">Recommended for cameras, gaming consoles, and power tools. Expanded incident coverage and expedited claims.</div>
        <div class="plan-features">
          <div class="plan-feature">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Up to ₹25,000 incident coverage
          </div>
          <div class="plan-feature">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Priority 24-hour claim resolution
          </div>
          <div class="plan-feature">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Direct replacement assistance
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Platinum -->
      <div class="plan-card reveal reveal-delay-4">
        <div style="font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:8px">Tier 03</div>
        <div class="plan-tier">Platinum</div>
        <div class="plan-description">Maximum protection scope for professional production rigs, cinema gear, and high-value equipment.</div>
        <div class="plan-features">
          <div class="plan-feature">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Up to ₹1,00,000 comprehensive cover
          </div>
          <div class="plan-feature">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Same-day resolution &amp; support
          </div>
          <div class="plan-feature">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Dedicated account concierge
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="deposit-notice reveal">
      <p>
        <strong>Logistics Notice:</strong> SkipIt does not operate logistics or shipping fleets. Item pickup, condition inspection, and safe return are coordinated directly between the renter and owner per the mutual rental agreement.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

